Crastu
======

Crastu is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). It includes the
third-party software and assets listed below. Licence texts are in the LICENSES/
directory, with the copyright lines of their authors, and each entry names the
files that hold its text.

Where a crate's package ships no licence file, the entry says so. For MIT, ISC,
BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0 the text in LICENSES/ is then generated
from the standard text, with a copyright line built from the authors in the crate's
manifest, and is marked as generated in its first lines. For any other licence the
entry carries a note instead of a text; those crates are also listed at the end.

Only what ends up in the shipped binaries is listed: the normal dependencies of
crastu-desktop and crastu-cli on macOS and Windows. Build scripts, procedural macros
and test-only crates are not.

This file and LICENSES/ are generated by `cargo xtask licences`; do not edit them
by hand. CI runs `cargo xtask licences --check`.

